  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。充滿愛打造。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Grabby Mobs 會修改遊戲機制，特別是針對遊戲中的生物。在原版 Minecraft 中，生物撿拾物品的機率非常低。此模組讓所有能撿拾物品的生物都能必定撿起物品。這樣你就能確保捕捉到的殭屍可以裝備華麗的頭盔。<br><br>可撿拾物品的生物：<br></span><span><strong>溺屍</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>喚魔者</strong>：不穿戴護甲<br><strong>尸殼</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>豬布林</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>蠻橫豬布林</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>骷髏</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>流浪者</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>惱魂鬼</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>衛道士</strong>：不穿戴護甲<br><strong>女巫</strong>：僅限主手<br><strong>凋靈骷髏</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>殭屍</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>殭屍村民</strong>：所有裝備<br><strong>殭屍化豬布林</strong>：所有裝備<br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套裝\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載連結仍托管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。<br>感謝支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
